## 🏆 Recommended Project: **IntelliDoc — Intelligent Multi-Modal Document Processing & Analysis Platform**

### Why This Project?

> This is a **real-world, industry-grade platform** that companies like Infocusp, and many enterprises are actively building. It combines **every major skill** from all 4 JDs into one cohesive project, and deploys on **AWS** with production-level MLOps.

### What It Does

IntelliDoc is an end-to-end platform that:
1. **Ingests** various document types (PDFs, images, scanned docs)
2. **Extracts** text and structured data using OCR + custom ML models
3. **Understands** content using NLP (classification, NER, summarization)
4. **Enables intelligent Q&A** using a RAG pipeline with LLMs + vector database
5. **Processes data** through scalable, automated pipelines
6. **Provides a dashboard** for analytics and insights

### Architecture Overview

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        FRONTEND (React)                         │
│   Upload Portal │ Search / Q&A │ Analytics Dashboard │ Admin    │
└──────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
           │
┌──────────▼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    API GATEWAY (FastAPI)                         │
│    REST APIs │ Auth │ Rate Limiting │ WebSocket (real-time)      │
└──────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
           │
    ┌──────┴──────────────────────────────┐
    │                                     │
┌───▼───────────────┐   ┌────────────────▼────────────────────┐
│  DATA PIPELINE    │   │  ML/AI ENGINE                       │
│                   │   │                                     │
│  • S3 Ingestion   │   │  • OCR (Tesseract/Textract)         │
│  • Apache Airflow │   │  • Doc Classification (PyTorch)     │
│  • Data Cleaning  │   │  • NER Extraction (Transformers)    │
│  • Feature Store  │   │  • Text Summarization               │
│  • SQL (Postgres) │   │  • Image Analysis (CV models)       │
│                   │   │  • Embeddings Generation            │
└───────────────────┘   └────────────────┬────────────────────┘
                                         │
                        ┌────────────────▼────────────────────┐
                        │  RAG PIPELINE                       │
                        │                                     │
                        │  • Vector DB (FAISS / ChromaDB)     │
                        │  • LLM Integration (open-source)    │
                        │  • Semantic Search                  │
                        │  • Context-Aware Q&A                │
                        └─────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    AWS INFRASTRUCTURE                            │
│  EC2 │ S3 │ RDS │ Lambda │ SageMaker │ CloudWatch │ Docker/ECS  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

