## 📋 Module Breakdown & JD Skill Mapping

### Module 1: Data Ingestion & Pipeline (Data Engineering)
**Skills Demonstrated:** Python, SQL, Data Pipelines, S3, Airflow

| Component | Tech Stack | JD Match |
|---|---|---|
| Document upload & storage | AWS S3, Boto3 | All JDs |
| Data pipeline orchestration | Apache Airflow on EC2 | AI-ML, Data Eng |
| Metadata extraction & storage | PostgreSQL (RDS) | AI-ML, Data Eng, Infocusp SW |
| Data cleaning & preprocessing | Pandas, NumPy | All JDs |
| Event-driven triggers | AWS Lambda, S3 Events | AI-ML, Infocusp SW |

---

### Module 2: ML/AI Models (Machine Learning Core)
**Skills Demonstrated:** ML/DL, NLP, CV, PyTorch, TensorFlow, Feature Engineering

| Component | Tech Stack | JD Match |
|---|---|---|
| OCR text extraction | Tesseract + custom fine-tuned model | AI-ML, Infocusp ML |
| Document classification | PyTorch (ResNet / BERT) | AI-ML, Infocusp ML |
| Named Entity Recognition | HuggingFace Transformers | AI-ML, Infocusp ML |
| Text summarization | T5 / BART models | AI-ML, Infocusp ML |
| Image/layout analysis | OpenCV + custom CNN | AI-ML, Infocusp ML |
| Feature engineering | Scikit-learn pipelines | AI-ML, Infocusp ML |

---

### Module 3: RAG Pipeline (GenAI & LLMs)
**Skills Demonstrated:** RAG, Vector DBs (FAISS), LLMs, Embeddings, GenAI

| Component | Tech Stack | JD Match |
|---|---|---|
| Document chunking | LangChain | AI-ML JD (bonus) |
| Embedding generation | Sentence-Transformers (local) | AI-ML, Infocusp ML |
| Vector storage & search | FAISS (exact match to JD!) | AI-ML JD (bonus) |
| LLM-powered Q&A | Open-source LLM (Mistral/LLaMA) | AI-ML JD |
| Context retrieval | Semantic search pipeline | AI-ML JD |

---

