| Managed database | AWS RDS (PostgreSQL) | Data Eng, Infocusp SW |
| Monitoring & logging | AWS CloudWatch | Infocusp SW |
| CI/CD pipeline | GitHub Actions → AWS | Infocusp SW |
| Infrastructure as Code | Terraform or AWS CDK | Infocusp SW |

