## 🎤 How This Impresses in Interviews

### For AI/ML Engineer Roles
> *"I built and trained custom NLP and CV models for document understanding, implemented a RAG pipeline with FAISS vector database for intelligent Q&A, and deployed everything on AWS SageMaker with automated retraining."*

### For Data Engineering Roles
> *"I designed end-to-end data pipelines using Airflow for document processing, managed metadata in PostgreSQL, and built event-driven architectures using AWS Lambda and S3 triggers."*

### For Software Engineering Roles (Infocusp)
> *"I built a scalable, production-grade platform with FastAPI backend, React frontend, Docker containerization, and full CI/CD on AWS with monitoring via CloudWatch."*

### For ML Research Roles (Infocusp ML)
> *"I applied deep learning to multi-modal data (text + images), implemented transformers for NER and classification, and built statistical validation pipelines to evaluate model performance."*

