## 💰 AWS Cost Estimation (Student Budget ~$200)

| Service | Estimated Monthly Cost |
|---|---|
| EC2 (t3.medium for backend) | ~$30 |
| RDS (db.t3.micro PostgreSQL) | ~$15 |
| S3 (10GB storage) | ~$0.25 |
| Lambda (event triggers) | Free tier |
| SageMaker (ml.t3.medium, limited use) | ~$20 |
| CloudWatch | Free tier |
| **Total / Month** | **~$65** |

> [!TIP]
> With $200 AWS credits, you can run this project for ~3 months — more than enough to build, demo, and interview.

